  "title": "extcap: Install extcap binaries under CMake's LIBEXECDIR",
  "description": "This is the standard location for program-specific helper executables.\n\nOn Debian LIBDIR is /usr/lib/@DEB_HOST_MULTIARCH@, while LIBEXECDIR\ndoes not include the multiarch directory, just it is /usr/libexec, that makes\nreferring to the excap binaries in scripts easier.\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit 6163af74268f49d1aae33d29d1239ec7d695ce6d)",
